Classified: OLD 10 (all scanned for machine-only AI(W906-*) tags / W906_ / Msk / s_ / k* identifiers missing from the laptop copy: 0), LOCAL 4 merged with 0 conflicts (merged-vs-machine adds/removes = laptop-vs-base, no machine line dropped; mymotor IDX1203 and bthermo PASSPROF marks kept), NEW 1; designer plugin folder (16 files) kept by rule. acarry.cpp / aoutarm9045_All_1Picker.cpp / docs/EVAL_THREADING_20261002.md / tests/test_flow9050_shuttle.cpp back to the machine's CRLF.

A = Frank01 F9050-FIX2 (HT9050 only; motion order changes -- stand by the machine on the first run): Loader slot data MMTrayZ -> MMTrayY (csystem DoReceiveAllToBottom_9050); Index Z1 safe = TestZ1_Safe +-10 (Do_Auto_InSH / Do_Auto_OutSH); Out Shuttle Y (M18) pushed to Right after Out Shuttle 1 leaves Index with parts, Out Arm does not pick until Y is at Right (acarry + aoutarm9045_All_1Picker); empty Loader trays always to Empty (acatchtray DoPlaceToBuffer_9050); Tray arm waits while In / Out Arm ZA is below the up point (mymotor TrayArmMotorMove).
B = Ifor01 IT-1 per golden: over-machine-limit set temperature -> WAR15194 + working temperature (G19a serial, G19b EJ1N, G19c DTME08, + the DTM map path); G25 ATC 6.0 block (only when ATC_SYSTEM says so; ATC not wired yet, EastSun 1006).

Also: WORKLOG item 132 -- EastSun 1006 '還沒接atc': the COM2 resets (DTK4848 Addr 1/2/4/5/8 silent) are expected.

o2 full build 0 errors; ctest 382/400 (new IT1_Bthermo passes; failures = the known list); production_audit 0 changes; Debug then release wb_serve rebuilt. WORKLOG section 3 row 159.

